    "name": "Effect: Martial Mayhem Mutagen (Greater)",
    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Martial Mayhem Mutagen (Greater)]</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit</strong> You gain a +3 item bonus to skill checks to Disarm, Grapple, Reposition, Shove, and Trip, and your melee Strikes deal 1d6 additional precision damage to off-guard creatures. When you succeed at a melee attack roll, the target is off-guard to your next attack roll against it before the start of your next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Drawback</strong> You take a –2 penalty to Will saves, Intelligence-based skill checks, and skill checks to Sense Motive. When you fail at a melee attack roll, you are clumsy 1 until the end of your next turn.</p>"
        },
